      <activity id="5813a693-0e37-5794-810f-b8c28b8bdcee" activityNameId="a59b0c2e-61b6-50cf-a984-53df8362997a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polystyrene foam slab, market mix, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polystyrene foam slab, market mix, at regional storage
pipeline transport is modelled as freight train transport.;
UUID: 6b096022-eb7b-3895-8274-648dd5975f80
This data set accounts for 1 kg of EPS at the regional storage. 16% are from import, 84% are produced in Switzerland. The imported share is weighted with a factor of 1.1. The average transport distance is 700 km. 6% are delievered by freight train, 92% by lorry and 2% by barge. Packaging material added according to dataset rock wool, packed, at plant/kg/CH, disposal of packaging material included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: undefined
Time period: undefined
Production volume: CH consumption of EPS: 186 kt (import and domestic production)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6b096022-eb7b-3895-8274-648dd5975f80.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
